'''Rainbow''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is made up of all the colors of the rainbow, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Rainbow (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was originally a promotional reward for purchasing any merchandise from [https://shopmm2.com/ shopmm2.com] before being moved to Knife Box 1.
*It has a [[Rainbow Fire|partner effect]] under the same name.
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/2032622/profile Maximum_ADHD] is the creator of this gun.

